  <History Date="14-02-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (note the 5, 6 and 7 channel modes in the charts all have just 4 channels and are identical.  similarly, the 13 channel mode only has 12)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="08-03-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with documentation provided by a customer where the 5, 6, 7 and 13 channel modes have matching channel offsets (the charts available on the manufacturer's website are still as above)" Version="1" />
  <History Date="08-03-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Also revises strobe function DMX range, program functions and changes 28 channel mode to 29 channels." Version="1" />
  <History Date="11-03-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase IDs to new modes." Version="2" />
